---
title: "C08 — Request and tenant boundary · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  HTTP[Request] --> Auth[JWT plus live session and DB membership]
  Auth --> Permission[Central PermissionGuard validates target route IDs]
  Permission --> DTO[Strict contract validation]
  DTO --> Service[Feature service]
  Service --> Mode{Read or write?}
  Mode -->|Read| Snapshot[Read-only RepeatableRead snapshot]
  Mode -->|Write| Lock[Lock workspace and reload mutable policy]
  Lock --> Validate[Validate relations, configuration and versions]
  Validate --> Write[Write rows and outbox atomically]
  Snapshot --> Repo[Tenant repositories]
  Write --> Repo
  Repo --> Scoped[All tenant data constrained by workspaceId]
  Scoped --> Response[Typed sanitized response]
  Body[Body IDs are targets, not acting identity] -. constraint .-> Auth
